WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
(music and applause)

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.730
- Hi, everybody.

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.110
Hi, Kelly Clarkson.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.070
- Hi, Rosie.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.660
- How are you? I haven't
seen you in 20 years.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.330
- I, I'm literally so excited about this.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:11.220
I am disappointed in myself
'cause you know how in your show

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.440
you have the thing to come out
for people with short legs--

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.273
- Yes.

00:00:14.273 --> 00:00:15.106
- That was one of my favorite
things about your show

00:00:15.106 --> 00:00:17.910
'cause I'm so short and I-
we need to work on that.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.087
- Yeah. Yeah. It was a good thing.

00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:21.810
Although, once William Shatner was there

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.020
and it malfunctioned, and
his feet were, I guess,

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.510
not touching and all of
a sudden he slid down

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:29.610
right out of the chair on live TV.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.214
- Well that's kind of funny as well.

00:00:31.214 --> 00:00:33.510
- Yeah, it's funny for a
moment, but I was worried.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.790
He's an elder gentleman, you know.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.230
I thought, "There goes
William Shatner's back."

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:38.430
I just killed William Shatner.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.780
- That's amazing.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.613
- Which you don't wanna do.

00:00:40.613 --> 00:00:42.150
- We haven't seen each other, though-

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:42.983
you said, "in 20 years."

00:00:42.983 --> 00:00:43.816
- Right.

00:00:43.816 --> 00:00:44.649
- I don't know if you remember,

00:00:44.649 --> 00:00:45.482
but we were on The Tonight Show.

00:00:45.482 --> 00:00:46.315
- Of course I remember, yes.

00:00:46.315 --> 00:00:48.660
- Okay, 'cause I was, I
actually went back and looked

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:49.620
at the interview cause I was, like, I know

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.480
we ran into each other,
but I was so annoying

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:52.313
because I was nervous.

00:00:52.313 --> 00:00:53.146
- [Rosie] No, no.

00:00:53.146 --> 00:00:54.570
- But I was so nervous 'cause I'm such a--

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.590
Look at my smile, I'm so excited.

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:57.423
(Rosie laughs)

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.790
Like, I literally, like,
every time someone says--

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.242
'cause I never thought
I'd have a TV show--

00:01:01.242 --> 00:01:03.537
but it was interesting-
I connected with you.

00:01:03.537 --> 00:01:04.919
And you're such a fan of things.

00:01:04.919 --> 00:01:05.752
- [Rosie] Yes.

00:01:05.752 --> 00:01:07.050
- And you're, like, a true fan.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.940
Like, I'm hoping to,
like, emulate that a bit.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:10.773
So I'm--

00:01:10.773 --> 00:01:12.300
- Well you did say to me, I
don't know if you remember,

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.340
you said, "I hope to
have a career like you."

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.780
- I did, I did.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:16.613
- You did say that to me.

00:01:16.613 --> 00:01:18.934
- But what's funny is, I
didn't mean, like, a talk show.

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:19.767
- Right.

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:20.600
- I meant longevity.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:21.433
- Right.

00:01:21.433 --> 00:01:23.280
- Yeah, I was- yeah, I was--
I didn't even mean that, so.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.440
- And I said to you,
you're gonna. I know it.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:26.273
- I know.

00:01:26.273 --> 00:01:27.106
- And here you are.

00:01:27.106 --> 00:01:27.939
- I know, thank you, Nostradamus.

00:01:27.939 --> 00:01:28.772
- You're welcome. It was me.

00:01:28.772 --> 00:01:29.605
- Yeah (Kelly laughs).

